`- Make green syntax the sole recovered representation
 `+ task
 `@ green-red-syntax-views
 `= created 2026-09-05T03:24:13+08:00

 Replace eager absolute-range ParsedDocument storage with typed red views over GreenDocument. Migrate folding,
 completion, formatting/editing and semantic inputs without reparsing or full-document materialization. Preserve
 fresh/incremental lossless and diagnostic parity, deep-tree stack safety, and current editor behavior. Acceptance
 requires didOpen and didChange end-to-end benchmarks with no common-path regression.

`- Finish semantic reducer deltas and equality invalidation
 `+ task
